<title>USA: Brooktrout Q3 profits to exceed estimates.</title>
<headline>Brooktrout Q3 profits to exceed estimates.</headline>
<dateline>NEEDHAM, Mass. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brooktrout Technology Inc said Thursday it expects revenue and profits for the third quarter ending September 30 will exceed analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>Revenue and profits are also expected to exceed those for the second quarter because of strong business in the company's fax and voice product lines, the company said.  </p>
<p>After a trading halt at 9:25 EST Thursday morning, Brooktrout was trading up 4 1/2 at 30 3/4. Its 52-week high is 32 5/8.</p>
</text>
